{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31124","headline":"闻李夷遇下第东归因以寄赠 · 薛能","name":"闻李夷遇下第东归因以寄赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"囊中书是居山写，海畔家贫乞食还。\n吾子莫愁登第晚，古人惟爱贱游闲。\n舟行散适江亭上，郡宴歌吟蜡烛间。\n从此乐章休叙战，汉兵无阵亦无蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31124.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31124","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}